@language_material_fluency_2026_11: ~"./language-material-fluency-2026-11.spw"  # cache: the runtime read as a small computer; what would make the language interesting to learn; legal combinatoric neighbors; wonder across fluencies; language histories with models and lenses; fiber, optic, ink, dye, finish, polymer as hypotheses beside material-physics
@concept_route_physics_2026_11: ~"./concept-route-physics-2026-11.spw"  # cache: five studio jobs as readings of one held line; a file is a world of lines; the runtime, the quest examples, and the canvas read that line; a babble is a ~ line offered across frames; a concept route carries its operator's packet
@brace_literal_local_law_2026_11: ~"./brace-literal-local-law-2026-11.spw"  # cache: a body folds to its braces as written and opens again, the operator before a brace is its body's law felt only by its own members, a question's body stays open; spw.quest (text toward shape), factshift.center (shape toward motion and back) and lore.land (text toward place) as three readings of one line; braces as charged particles (1/d in a plane), a word as an atom and a line's shape as its structural formula, the body as a well with no braces in its name, fractal tuning, the menu's reading family
@factshift_theory_of_mind_2026_11: ~"./factshift-theory-of-mind-2026-11.spw"  # cache: what each reader (phone, desk, image model, agent, performer, learner) predicts a hand does; three axes (breadth across, depth by pinch, strata up and down); quick changes a state and slow an amount; a body's edges step its siblings as the screen's step history; a summary is an outline chosen by width; stress numbers: authored Spw is flat, play nests, juxtaposed statements are one part to the slot reader
@canvas_corpus_design_2026_11: ~"./canvas-corpus-design-2026-11.spw"  # cache: every statement of spw-workbench and spwashi.com (48,407) through the canvas's readers: a summary overflow found and fixed (app c4b0ca1), unread boxes ranked by cause, shapes too coarse or too fine, density and the thread's 40-row limit; proposals: physics written in Spw (a tuning line), memory as one dated document, reflex as operator impulses, comparable stills, laws a reader can choose, fractal shapes, slot-hash layouts, texture as grain
@factshift_tooling_2026_11: ~"./factshift-tooling-2026-11.spw"  # cache: tooling selection and behavior read against TOOLS.md: two tool systems under one word, grow with six laws, a tap verb that raises alert(); proposals: one verb registry, a tool as the verb its window primes, operators on the mode column, verbs that take the innermost object, receipts with one undo, profiles (=tools{…}) and chains; slices T0 to T5
@ecosystem_productization_2026_11: ~"./ecosystem-productization-2026-11.spw"  # cache: lite interpreters as lite + one dialect profile + one codec, one release every consumer takes, the workbench's sockets and asks; lore.land's trope ecology and texture grammar; a residency's texture read from its index; an ephemeral registry of sponsored themes closing on the site's dates; events as dated tuning lines with saveable snippets; partial compilation to CSS, shader uniforms and a force tensor
@quest_library_router_2026_11: ~"./quest-library-router-2026-11.spw"  # cache: spw.quest's routes as verbs over a library, with /cluster and /document; one selection grammar across apps; diffs at the highest stratum they reach and resonance as a pattern's echo; six semantic-physics experiments; describability as a sheaf over containers, the summary as restriction, mutations previewing their wake; a taste ledger, never scored
@site_alignment_2026_11: ~"./site-alignment-2026-11.spw"  # cache: components and illustrations read against the runtime; built: a reader-free fractal summary in the kernel used where cauldron chips cut Spw, and the crumb travelling with the reader; next: settings as one expression, one spelling per setting, travel landing with a link's arrival, <spw-expression> on the reader, illustrations that say their state, chrome motion on the tokens
@read_aloud_typography_2026_11: ~"./read-aloud-typography-2026-11.spw"  # cache: copy read out loud: spoken twins for Spw built from operator and slot names, stress carried by em and end focus, mono that reads as typed (no contextual alternates for Spw), a pronunciation register the creator writes, a read-aloud sensor
@spw_settings_integration_2026_11: ~"./spw-settings-integration-2026-11.spw"  # cache: settings have words and readable query keys but never a Spw line; the ladder from one spelling per setting to the look as a mutating line, the line as input, Home's tuning as an expression, self-tuning components, and one tuning grammar across the apps

operation = "align"
fixity = "tending"

^"cold"{
  note = `Lineage only. Quote successors in owner-registry, not these July counts.`
  recursive_improvement_2026_07 = @recursive_improvement_cache
  feature_wiring_timing_2026_07 = @feature_wiring
  spw_language_utilization_2026_07 = @language_utilization
}[reg=facet]

^"registry"{
  implicit_attention_arcs = @implicit_attention_arcs
  morph_shader_handles = @morph_shader_handles
  css_combinatorics = @css_combinatorics
  arrival_perceptibility_2026_08 = @arrival_perceptibility
  delegation_parcels_2026_08 = @delegation_parcels
  precipitate_2026_08_14 = @precipitate_2026_08_14
  region_ecology_materials = @region_ecology_materials
  boonhonk_combinatoric_genre = @boonhonk_combinatoric_genre
